@baseUrl = http://localhost:5011

### Baseline: internal_cost is visible now. Your refactor must hide it.
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Existing product
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Invalid id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/abc

### Valid but missing id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/999

### Baseline: internal_cost is accepted now. Your refactor must ignore it.
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Cable",
  "description": "Durable 1 metre USB-C charging cable",
  "price": 290,
  "category": "electronics",
  "stock": 30,
  "product_id": 999,
  "internal_cost": 100
}

### Invalid body
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Missing other required values"
}
